Data attribution notice
-----------------------

The files under data/ are derived from:

Victorian Department of Transport and Planning Open Data, "Traffic Signal
Volume Data", available from the Victorian Government / data.gov.au open data
catalogues.

The source Traffic Signal Volume Data resources used for this project are
listed by the public data catalogue under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0
Australia licence. The derived train/test NPZ files are provided for research
reproducibility and should be used with attribution to the original publisher.

This software license does not supersede the source data licence or any
attribution requirements attached to the original Traffic Signal Volume Data.

Topology attribution notice
---------------------------

The checked Melbourne road-network topology metadata includes information
derived from OpenStreetMap.

OpenStreetMap data is available under the Open Data Commons Open Database
License (ODbL). Required attribution: (c) OpenStreetMap contributors.

This software license does not supersede the ODbL terms or attribution
requirements attached to OpenStreetMap-derived data.
